From 378224a362b428e07bdae7ac350fc230d26f9a12 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Geoff Miller <contributor@example.invalid>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:09:39 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 25/27] feat: record memo statistics before pressure actions

Capture bounded estimated memo state before shed and refuse cache eviction.
Keep steady samples and emergency exit free of diagnostic reads.

Verified: focused governor race tests and representative stats/format benchmark
with Go 1.27.1. Existing diagnostic regressions retained. Full gate pending.
